    "result_text": "The full build succeeds. The suite reports `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` with **BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipTier` business rule for the PetClinic owner endpoint:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `membershipTier` string field to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it in the `GET /api/owners/{id}` response.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a derived `getMembershipTier()` getter (mirroring the existing `getMembershipNumber()` style) that returns `\"SILVER\"` when `namesakeCount` is 0 **and** an email is present, otherwise `\"BRONZE\"`.\n\nMapStruct auto-maps the matching getter onto the DTO field (same mechanism already used for `membershipNumber`), so no mapper change was needed.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests pass:\n- `coreSilverWhenUniqueWithEmail` \u2192 unique owner with email yields `SILVER`\n- `functionalityBronzeWhenNoEmail` \u2192 owner without email yields `BRONZE`",
